<title>NEW ZEALAND: FORECAST-Consensus survey of NZ employment data.</title>
<headline>FORECAST-Consensus survey of NZ employment data.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following is a table of economists' forecasts for the December quarter Household Labour Force Survey, due from Statistics New Zealand at 10.45 a.m. (2145 GMT) on Tuesday.</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>DEC QUARTER HOUSEHOLD LABOUR FORCE SURVEY (s/adj, percent)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>		   Unemployment   Qtrly    Yrly pt-pt  Participation</p>
<p>			 rate     employment employment	rate</p>
<p>					growth     growth</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    AMP		6.5	   0.4	  3.2	    66.6</p>
<p>    ANZ		6.6	   0.1	  2.9	    66.4</p>
<p>    ASB		6.3	   0.0	  2.8	     --</p>
<p>    DEUTSCHE	 6.5	   0.2	  3.0	    66.5</p>
<p>    BANCORP	  6.25	  0.6	  2.3	    66.1</p>
<p>    BNZ		6.5	   0.4	  3.2	    66.6</p>
<p>    NATIONAL	 6.4	   0.3	  3.1	    66.4</p>
<p>    BT		 6.6	   0.0	  2.8	    66.8</p>
<p>    DOYLE	    6.2	   0.4	  3.2	    66.2</p>
<p>    FIRST NZ	 6.4	   0.6	  3.4	    66.6</p>
<p>    WARBURG	  6.5	   0.4	  3.2	    66.6</p>
<p>    WESTPACTRUST   6.3	   0.5	  3.3	    66.4</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>    AVERAGE	  6.42	  0.325	3.03	   66.47</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64 4) 4734746</p>
